      "section_header": "TEMPLATE: FINANCE & ACCOUNTS  |  BLUEPRINT STEP 01 / 04",
      "narration": "Creating an enterprise annual budget begins with Phase One: establishing your historical baseline and strategic alignment. Review the past twelve months of actual spend, lock in realistic revenue growth targets, and align every department head on macro inflation assumptions before issuing budget templates.",
